---

---

<div>
    <div
        id="feature-details-wrap"
        class="flex justify-center px-0 md:px-[10%] pt-[3.5rem] md:pb-[7rem] lg:py-[180px] bg-fixed bg-no-repeat bg-top bg-black"
        style="background-image: url('images/04_Image_BG_02.webp');"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px] md:pr-[3%]"
            style="
            display: flex;
            justify-content: end;
        "
        >
            <div
                class="w-full mt-[350px] md:mt-0 md:w-1/2 backdrop-blur-xl px-[10%] md:px-0 pb-[7rem] md:pb-0 md:backdrop-blur-none md:pl-[8.4%] pt-10 md:pt-0"
            >
                <h2 class="text-4xl py-4 font-bold">Powertrains</h2>
                <p class="py-3 text-3xl font-light text-[#CB8337]">
                    Mazda’s reputation for fun and engaging vehicles is once
                    again apparent with the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90,
                    featuring a powertrain line-up that’s as versatile as it is
                    impressive.
                </p>
                <p class="py-2 font-light">
                    Both the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 are available with
                    all-new six-cylinder engines that offers the performance,
                    refinement, and economy you would expect from SUVs of this
                    calibre. There is also a plug-in hybrid powertrain available
                    exclusively in the Mazda CX-60.
                </p>
                <p class="py-2 font-light">
                    All models feature a smooth-shifting eight-speed automatic
                    transmission, and the sure-footed traction of all-wheel
                    drive.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="flex justify-center flex-col-reverse md:flex-row bg-black backdrop-blur-xl [z-index:100]"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px] flex-col md:flex-row"
            style="
            display: flex;
            justify-content: end;
        "
        >
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 p-[10%] md:p-[180px] pt-10 xl:pr-10 mb-28"
            >
                <h3 class="text-4xl py-3 font-bold">Safety</h3>
                <p class="py-3 text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-[#CB8337]">
                    Safety features are a priority for Australian families, and
                    this is another area where the Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90
                    excel.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    Equipped with Mazda’s i-Activsense suite of safety
                    technologies, this ensures a high level of safety for all
                    passengers.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    Advanced features like autonomous emergency braking,
                    blind-spot monitoring, and a 360-degree-view monitor are
                    like an extra watchful eye on the road and your
                    surroundings.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 pr-2">
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block my-4 md:my-0 [top:-100px] md:[top:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/04_Image_Still_03.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
                <img
                    class="relative inline-block md:[top:auto] [top:-50px] md:[bottom:-40px] px-12 md:px-20"
                    src="images/04_Image_Still_04.webp"
                    alt=""
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="md:bg-cover bg-no-repeat [] bg-black md:bg-top flex flex-col md:flex-row px-0 md:px-[10%] justify-center"
        style="background-image:url('images/04_Image_BG_03.webp');background-size:200%;background-position:bottom;"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px] flex-col md:flex-row"
            style="
            display: flex;
            justify-content: end;
        "
        >
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-[10%] md:px-[2%] py-10 lg:py-[170px] mt-10 lg:mt-[150px] mb-10 lg:mb-[100px] md:mb-0 md:mt-[400px] md:bg-none [background:linear-gradient(to_top,#000_0%,#000_90%,transparent_100%)] xl:pl-[9.1%] xl:pr-[6%]"
            >
                <div class="md:bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] md:p-10">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl py-3 font-bold">
                        2.5L e-Skyactiv PHEV
                    </h2>
                    <p class="py-3 text-3xl font-light text-[#CB8337]">
                        The most powerful and efficient powertrain in the Mazda
                        CX-60 is Mazda’s first plug-in hybrid.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4 font-light">
                        Combining a 2.5-litre four-cylinder engine with a
                        powerful electric motor, it boasts a total system output
                        of 241 kW and 500 Nm of torque.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4 font-light">
                        The 17.8 kilowatt-hour battery offers an electric-only
                        driving range of up to 76 kilometres, making it ideal
                        for daily commutes.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4 font-light">
                        Plug it in when you get home, and it will be fully
                        charged by morning with a charge from empty easily
                        completed on a standard 240-volt wall outlet in
                        approximately 10 hours.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-4 font-light">
                        The PHEV model is a symbol of Mazda’s forward-thinking,
                        offering drivers both the joy of driving, and efficiency
                        without compromise.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 px-[10%] md:px-[2%] py-10 lg:py-[170px] md:bg-none [background:linear-gradient(to_top,#000_0%,#000_86%,rgba(0,0,0,0.1)_91%,transparent_100%)] xl:pl-[7.5%] xl:pr-[6%]"
            >
                <div class="md:bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.4)] md:p-10">
                    <h2 class="text-4xl py-3 font-bold">
                        3.3L In-line 6-cylinder e-Skyactiv G
                    </h2>
                    <p class="py-3 text-3xl font-light text-[#CB8337]">
                        The 3.3-litre inline six-cylinder turbo-petrol engine
                        with M Hybrid Boost technology is able to be as
                        efficient as a naturally aspirated engine, while
                        significantly reducing emissions, thanks to its larger
                        capacity.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-2 font-light">
                        A powerful 209 kW and 450 Nm of torque in on offer in
                        the Mazda CX-60, and an impressive 254 kW of power and
                        500 Nm of torque in the Mazda CX-90.
                    </p>
                    <p class="py-2 font-light">
                        This new engine offers exciting acceleration and an
                        addictive exhaust note, without compromising on fuel
                        economy or environmental responsibility.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div
        class="w-full text-white flex flex-col bg-black md:bg-cover md:bg-right bg-no-repeat"
        style="background-image: url('images/05_Image_BG_01.webp');background-size:cover;"
    >
        <div
            class="flex flex-col backdrop-blur-xl py-8 items-center w-full"
            id="driving-experience"
        >
            <div
                class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px]"
                style="
                display: flex;
                justify-content: end;
            "
            >
                <div class="px-[10%] md:px-[20%]">
                    <h3 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center py-4">
                        Driving Experience
                    </h3>
                    <p
                        class="text-2xl text-center py-4 text-[#e3b383] md:text-[#e3b383]"
                    >
                        Whether navigating tight city streets, cruising on the
                        highway, or exploring winding mountain roads, both the
                        Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 deliver a driving experience
                        that’s exhilarating when you want it to be and relaxing
                        when you need it.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full flex justify-center md:px-[10%]">
            <div
                class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px]"
                style="
                display: flex;
                justify-content: end;
            "
            >
                <div
                    class="w-full md:w-1/2 mt-[600px] md:mt-0 pt-10 pb-[100px] px-0 md:px-[5%]"
                >
                    <div
                        class="md:bg-[rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] backdrop-blur-md md:backdrop-blur-0 px-10 py-6"
                    >
                        <p class="py-4">
                            Adaptive cruise control, lane-keeping assist, and
                            blind-spot monitoring, work together to reduce the
                            stress of driving, allowing you to focus on the
                            journey.
                        </p>
                        <p class="py-4">
                            The integration of Mazda Intelligent Drive Select
                            allows you to customise the driving experience,
                            adapting the vehicle’s dynamics to match your mood
                            and the road ahead.
                        </p>
                        <p class="py-4">
                            With a range of powertrain options and advanced
                            driver assistance features, these impressive
                            vehicles cater to a wide range of drivers.
                        </p>
                        <p class="py-4">
                            The Mazda CX-60 promises a driving experience that’s
                            not only engaging and responsive, but also safe and
                            efficient. The Mazda CX-90 is made for long road
                            trips, with a quietness and comfort that makes
                            covering huge distances feel like a walk across the
                            street.
                        </p>
                        <p class="py-4">
                            Mazda’s Jinba-Ittai philosophy, the unity of horse
                            and rider, is clear from the engaging driving
                            experience on these models.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div
        class="!bg-cover bg-no-repeat !bg-top md:!bg-bottom flex justify-end px-[10%] justify-center"
        style="background-image: url('images/06_Image_BG_01.webp'); background-size: auto 122%; background-position-x: -20rem;"
    >
        <div
            class="max-w-[1400px] xl:max-w-[2000px]"
            style="
            display: flex;
            justify-content: end;
        "
        >
            <div
                class="w-full md:w-1/2 md:px-[80px] pb-[1000px] pt-10 md:py-[250px] md:pl-[8.4%]"
            >
                <h2 class="text-6xl md:text-7xl py-3 font-light">
                    A sanctuary on the move
                </h2>
                <p class="py-3 text-3xl font-bold">
                    The Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    With their distinct designs, luxurious interiors,
                    cutting-edge features, advanced technologies, and powerful
                    yet efficient powertrains, Mazda CX-60 and Mazda CX-90 cater
                    to a broad range of driving preferences and lifestyles.
                </p>
                <p class="py-4 font-light">
                    Whether one seeks the agility of the Mazda CX-60 or the
                    opulent serenity of the Mazda CX-90, these vehicles offer a
                    driving experience that surpasses mere mobility, inviting
                    drivers on a journey where every kilometre celebrates the
                    art of the drive.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    @media (min-width: 1024) {
        /* Your styles for screens below 870px width */

        #feature-details-wrap {
            background-position-x: -60rem;
            background-size: 176% auto;
            background: fixed;
        }
    }
    #feature-details-wrap {
        background-position-x: -60rem;
        background-size: 100%;
        background: fixed;
        /* background-repeat: no-repeat; */
        background-position: center 20% !important;
    }
</style>
